<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">BOC / SINA · {{pair}} / CNY</view>
  <view class="heading">美元结汇观察</view>
  <view class="subtitle">关注每一次变化，把握你的结汇时机</view>
  <view wx:if="{{status.demo}}" class="warn">演示模式 · 全部行情为模拟数据，不发送微信通知</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warn error">{{error}} <text bindtap="refresh">点击重试</text></view>
  <scroll-view class="chips" scroll-x="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
    <view wx:for="{{pairsInfo}}" wx:key="pair" class="chip {{pair === item.pair ? 'active' : ''}}" data-pair="{{item.pair}}" bindtap="pairTap">{{item.pair}}</view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="card quote">
    <view class="row"><text class="muted">{{quoteLabel}}</text><text class="tag">{{quoteStale ? '报价过期' : '结汇参考'}}</text></view>
    <view class="price">{{quotePrice}}<text class="unit"> {{unitLabel}}</text></view>
    <view class="muted">1 {{pair}} 兑人民币 · 每 30 秒检查更新 · 来源可切换</view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="row muted"><text>{{quoteTime}}</text><text bindtap="refresh">刷新 ↻</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{quoteStale}}" class="error small">报价已过期或尚未取得，请勿当作实时价格</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab === 'chart' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="chart" bindtap="selectTab">走势分析</view><view class="tab {{tab === 'rules' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="rules" bindtap="selectTab">监测提醒</view><view class="tab {{tab === 'alerts' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="alerts" bindtap="selectTab">提醒记录</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'chart'}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="chart-head"><text class="section">汇率走势</text><text class="muted">{{pairLabel}} · {{rangeLabel}}</text></view>
      <view class="row ranges"><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="*this" class="range {{rangeIndex === index ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="rangeTap">{{item}}</view></view>
      <ec-canvas id="rateChart" canvas-id="rate-chart" ec="{{ec}}"></ec-canvas>
      <view wx:if="{{!pointCount}}" class="empty">该时段暂无数据，历史记录从采集开始积累</view>
      <button class="toggle" bindtap="reverseChange">{{reverse ? '正向换算：1 外币 = ? 人民币' : '反向换算：1 人民币 = ? 外币'}}</button>
      <view class="muted">拖动/双指缩放图表 · 每个来源一条线，图例可点击显隐</view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="source-table">
        <view class="source-row head"><text>来源</text><text>最新价</text><text>涨跌</text><text>时间</text></view>
        <view wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="source" class="source-row">
          <view class="source-name"><view class="sw" style="background:{{item.color}}"></view><text>{{item.label}}</text></view>
          <text>{{item.displayPrice}}</text>
          <text class="{{item.changeClass}}">{{item.displayChange}}</text>
          <text class="{{item.stale ? 'error' : ''}}">{{item.displayTime}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">中行为银行牌价，新浪为公开市场行情，口径不同；无数据的来源显示 —。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'rules'}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section">新建监测 · {{pairLabel}}</view>
      <view class="row"><text>每天监测时段</text><picker mode="time" value="{{start}}" bindchange="startChange"><view class="field">{{start}}</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="time" value="{{end}}" bindchange="endChange"><view class="field">{{end}}</view></picker></view>
      <view class="muted">北京时间，支持跨午夜；每天自动重置提醒。规则按当前货币对与来源触发。</view>
      <radio-group bindchange="kindChange" class="choices"><label><radio value="movement" checked="{{kind === 'movement'}}" color="#11695c"/>波动提醒</label><label><radio value="target" checked="{{kind === 'target'}}" color="#11695c"/>目标价</label></radio-group>
      <view class="muted">{{kind === 'movement' ? '以时段内首个新报价为基准，上涨、下跌各提醒一次。' : '达到或越过目标即触发，每个监测日提醒一次。'}}</view>
      <view class="field row"><text>{{kind === 'movement' ? '上下波动 ±' : '目标汇率'}}</text><input type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="amountChange" placeholder="{{kind === 'movement' ? '0.01' : '6.70'}}"/><text>元</text></view>
      <picker wx:if="{{kind === 'target'}}" range="{{directions}}" value="{{directionIndex}}" bindchange="directionChange"><view class="field">{{directions[directionIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
      <button class="primary" bindtap="saveRule" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存监测规则</button>
      <button class="subscribe" bindtap="subscribe">授权微信提醒</button>
      <view class="muted">普通订阅消息通常为一次授权一次发送，不能保证无限后台推送；额度不足需重新授权。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{status && !status.notifications_ready}}" class="error small">微信通知尚未接入，当前仅记录触发事件。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section">我的监测 <text class="muted">{{rules.length}} / 20</text></view><view wx:if="{{!rules.length}}" class="empty">还没有监测规则</view><view wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="id" class="rule"><view class="row"><text>{{item.kind === 'movement' ? '波动 ±' : (item.direction === 'above' ? '目标 ≥' : '目标 ≤')}} {{item.amount}} 元</text><text class="error small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deleteRule">删除</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.pair_label || '美元'}} · {{item.source_label || '中行现汇买入'}} · 每天 {{item.start}} – {{item.end}}</view></view></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'alerts'}}" class="card"><view class="section">最近触发记录</view><view wx:if="{{!alerts.length}}" class="empty">暂未触发提醒</view><view wx:for="{{alerts}}" wx:key="id" class="rule"><view class="row"><text>{{item.label}} · {{item.price}} 元</text><text class="tag">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.sourceLabel}}{{item.displayTime}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.detail}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="footer"><view>多来源汇率观察 · 每 30 秒检查更新</view><view>数据来源：中行牌价 / 新浪财经 / 公开日更汇率 · 非投资建议</view></view>
</view>
